---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Copyright & DMCA Policy - BiliExtract"
  description="Copyright compliance statement, Digital Millennium Copyright Act (17 U.S.C. § 512) notice, and takedown procedures for BiliExtract."
  canonical="https://biliextract.com/legal/copyright-disclaimer/"
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="card legal-card">
        <h1>Copyright & DMCA Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated-date">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

        <p class="lead-statement">
          At <strong>BiliExtract</strong>, we respect the intellectual property rights of content creators, artists, and rights holders worldwide. We operate strictly in compliance with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (17 U.S.C. § 512) and international copyright legislation.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2>1. Nature of Our Service</h2>
          <p>
            BiliExtract is an independent web-based utility tool.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not host, store, stream, or re-transmit any media files, audio tracks, or videos on our servers.
          </p>
          <p>
            All conversions and file retrievals occur transiently and on demand, requested directly by the client (the end user).
          </p>
          <p>
            The tool acts strictly as a technical intermediary, parsing publicly accessible streaming links hosted on external third-party content delivery networks.
          </p>
          <p>
            No files are indexed or permanently archived by our system.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Fair Use & Third-Party Content</h2>
          <p>
            Our utility is designed for lawful purposes, such as personal offline backups, research, archiving creative works, and educational fair-use studies. We do not encourage, condone, or support the unauthorized distribution or commercial resale of copyrighted material.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Submitting a Takedown Notice</h2>
          <p>
            If you are a copyright owner or an authorized agent representing one, and you believe a specific URL accessible via our utility infringes upon your rights, please provide us with a formal DMCA takedown request containing the following:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Identification of the copyrighted work claimed to have been infringed (title, author, or link to original source).</li>
            <li>Identification of the material or URL processed through our service that you wish to have disabled or blacklisted.</li>
            <li>Your contact information, including your full legal name, physical mailing address, telephone number, and official email address.</li>
            <li>A statement of good-faith belief that the contested use is not authorized by the copyright owner, its agent, or the law.</li>
            <li>A statement under penalty of perjury that the information in your notification is accurate and that you are authorized to act on behalf of the copyright holder.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Submitting Takedown Requests</h2>
          <p>
            Please submit all DMCA and intellectual property inquiries via our <a href="/legal/contact/" class="text-link">Contact Page</a>. We review and process verified notices within 24 to 48 hours.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 60px 0 80px;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .legal-card {
    padding: 48px;
  }
  .legal-card h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .updated-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .lead-statement {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  .legal-card section {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .legal-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .legal-card ul {
    margin: 14px 0 14px 24px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-card li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .text-link {
    color: var(--orange-500);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .text-link:hover {
    color: var(--orange-600);
  }
</style>
